        <tr>
          <td valign="top"><font face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif" size="4" color="#333333">Dragon, Dragon, Mudball, Dragon</font></td>
        </tr>
        <tr> 
          <td valign="top"><font face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif" color="#333333" size="2">
            <table border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="3">
  <tr> 
    <td colspan="2"> 
      <p><font face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif" size="2" color="#333333">Servers getting yanked down = free loot for us!  Killed Lendi while waiting for people to log on, moved to Skyshrine for a quick hit on Yelinak, then finished the night with a picnic beside Cazic Thule's corpse.  Next day, Klandicar joined the kill count.  Grats to Glen, Tanvenu, and Lannear on Sleeper's Keys!  Dauk and Fedmahn are styling in new breastplates, Nimowei is sporting new gloves, Ionnin sent the old neon bathrobe to the cleaners, and the clerics are trying to rez kittens as fast as Ortin (cazic brain) and I (cazic eye) keep killing them :/</td></tr>
<br>
<tr><td><img src="http://www.mokb.org/cgi-bin/SS/SS1353.jpg" width="194" height="364">     <img src="http://www.mokb.org/cgi-bin/SS/SS1354.jpg" width="281" height="364"</td></tr>
<br>
<tr>
<td colspan="2"><img src="http://www.mokb.org/cgi-bin/SS/SS1355.jpg" width="440" height="330"<br> </font></p>
    </td>
  </tr>
</table>

			
			</font>
          </td>
        </tr>
		
        <tr> 
