    <td colspan="2"> 
      <p><font face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif" size="2" color="#333333"> Few First Broods down, grats us on more ST keys and assorted loot.  New secret Yelinak strat: have him choke to death on a gnome.  Made Hosh wish he was still spawning as a bag in VP, and finished up a couple epics yay!<br>
<img src="http://www.mokb.org/cgi-bin/SS/SS1350.jpg" width="667" height="404"> <br>
<b>Congrats to Shanhara and Amadeuse on their new weapons!</b><br>
<img src="http://www.mokb.org/cgi-bin/SS/SS1351.jpg" width="600" height="400"<br> </font></p>
