    <td colspan="2"> 
      <p><font face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif" size="2" color="#333333">Not 
        much going on this week. NWN been owning turnout. Killed a few wimpy mobs 
        like Trak, and killed Dain a few times<br>
